      "created_at": "2021-03-16T14:07:47.331Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Good luck to us all</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-170-writers-room-dark-watch-annual-3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/2/2195fb0b2700b1df502aa120a68af896730a6609.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-170-writers-room-dark-watch-annual-3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Episode #170 - Writers' Room: Dark Watch Annual #3</a></h3>\n\n<p>I hope you're wearing green today!   Show Notes: Run Time: 1:30:36 Some goofs, but then, a story! Actually, no, then another set of goofs. And THEN a story. Lots of interesting stuff in this one. Building out a whole set of stuff that we've had...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/0/04babf941a4439228f8065eafa4e4194f8e6625c.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/04babf941a4439228f8065eafa4e4194f8e6625c\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/04babf941a4439228f8065eafa4e4194f8e6625c_2_322x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"FQ10YNFQtkoJY6GEgtWuSj3lOk\" width=\"322\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/04babf941a4439228f8065eafa4e4194f8e6625c_2_322x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/04babf941a4439228f8065eafa4e4194f8e6625c_2_483x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/04babf941a4439228f8065eafa4e4194f8e6625c_2_644x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/04babf941a4439228f8065eafa4e4194f8e6625c_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">2640×4093 1.82 MB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
