      "id": 236070,
      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2021-03-16T16:26:49.088Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I’m with Adam. Heck punching dinosaurs, punch a paleontologist who’s dedicated to making them suck! &gt;:V</p>\n<p>“Son, do you even know how bad your luck is?” This line is great. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=9\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>\n<p>Wait, he <em>is</em> Wager Master? I was right all along! D: That shit-eating grin gives it away!</p>\n<p>Fae-touched Setback variant when?</p>\n<p>I’m really liking this story, because I had been under the impression there would never be interaction with the fae realms in Sentinel Comics, and now, here we are.</p>\n<p>Loving this segment of Wager Master absolutely losing his tiny shit. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=9\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>\n<p>I feel like Anthony Drake has always been Irish-American? c.c Is that just me? Did anyone else wonder if they’d completely forgotten about him for a minute there?</p>\n<p>Aww, Adam. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/frowning.png?v=9\" title=\":frowning:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":frowning:\"></p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-03-16T16:27:35.123Z",
      "reply_count": 1,
